add('lem-qftx-local-integrable-dolbeault-frames','The fixed-support Holder Cauchy estimate and smooth-parameter Cauchy supplier give a uniformly small rescaled contraction. Operator-norm inverse identities and derivative gain prove joint smoothness; square-zero curvature makes untouched coefficients holomorphic and preserves killed coordinates through finite induction. Iterated Cauchy formula makes transitions/intertwiners holomorphic. This local construction needs neither GAGA nor global vanishing.', 'root-old60-support-review/review.json')
add('lem-qftx-twistor-line-section-direct-image','The exact full GAGA interface now supplies its previously missing analytic/relative comparison. The universal real-line family uses the actual proper-flat perfect-complex and affine-localized direct-image suppliers, constant fiber H0 and vanishing H1, Nakayama and cohomology/base-change to derive degree-zero evaluation/base-change in its specified locally-free range. It does not assume generic degree-zero surjectivity or extend beyond the stated family hypotheses.',old,integ,'root-analytic-integration-20261023/old60-range-root-receipt.json')
add('lem-qftx-raw-adhm-real-twistor-block','Direct multiplication proves DD*=diag(f,f), the exact two moment coefficients and sigma reality. Stable-word/common-eigenvector arguments prove the precise ranks; positive f gives the projection, differentiated projection gives the displayed ASD two-form basis. The Euler blocks on each real line and infinity give triviality/framing and exact torus chain factors. This is a forward construction; inverse normalization/global charge remain separate suppliers.', 'root-old60-support-review/review.json')
add('thm-qftx-framed-penrose-ward-correspondence-on-s4','The actual local integrable-Dolbeault frames lemma now proves the missing smooth-to-holomorphic step and intertwiner naturality; its square-zero condition follows from the exact positive orientation incidence. The current universal-line direct-image and GAGA suppliers supply evaluation and qualified families. Ward reality gives the metric connection, determinant-flat normalization supplies charge conventions. No arbitrary family base-change or Penrose transform is postulated.',old,integ,'root-old60-support-review/review.json')
