add('thm-qftx-gaga-analytic-local-coherent-polydisc-acyclicity','Canonical65 identity is restored. Scalar Dolbeault resolution and smooth-module acyclicity give ordinary sheaf acyclicity of O on the chosen polydisc. Oka coherence supplies a partial finite-free resolution of the fixed coherent module of length2N+1 on one sufficiently small W; dimension shifting reaches q+ell>2N and the actual ordinary Euclidean dimension bound kills the last kernel. No injective leftmost free term, uniform W for all modules or analytic/algebraic cohomology comparison is assumed. Metric-Cech F12 support is bound to the current source supplement.', 'batch65-cohomology-repair/review.md',local,'root-analytic-integration-20261023/batch65-66-root-receipt.json','private-preparation/root-contract-repair-65-67-v1/review.json')
