add('thm-qftx-gaga-analytic-compact-projective-coherent-finiteness','For every stated r0..3 and q, common nested covers resolve each parent presentation and relation kernel, with avoidance refinements giving actual SAME-presentation section surjectivity. Pseudoconvex intersection acyclicity identifies Cech/sheaf cohomology; compact restriction maps and the corrected Frechet-complex theorem give closed finite-codimensional boundaries and Hausdorff finite-dimensional cohomology. The exact65/Oka/topology chain is now supplied; topology and cover independence are retained.', 'batch66-cohomology-repair/review.md',fin,'batch66-cohomology-repair/consumer59-review.json')
