add('ex-qftx-gaga-analytic-finite-not-vanishing','The actual two-chart analytic Laurent calculation leaves precisely c_-1 for H1(P1,O(-2))=C; other Laurent tails extend analytically in the required charts, including the correct unbounded C* convention. Current Oka and compact coherent finiteness supply the declared inputs. Finite-dimensional cohomology is not confused with vanishing; no GAGA group comparison is used.', 'batch66-cohomology-repair/review.md',fin)
