add('thm-qftx-coupled-penrose-vanishing','The proved global injective edge and derived R/6 coupled operator send H1(E(-2)) into the kernel of nabla*nabla+2. The actual ASD positive-orientation convention and integrated nonnegative energy kill that kernel. Repeating for the unitary dual proves the second vanishing, naturally and with arbitrary flat/reducible summands. Exact67 analytic fiber groups and the explicit Green construction are current; no GAGA, monad inverse or generic Penrose citation is used.',pen,penroot,'root-projective-dolbeault-review/review.json')
